# Line-ending policy: every platform checks out and commits LF, so Windows
# contributors (core.autocrlf) cannot inject CRLF into source files or test
# fixtures. The pre-commit hooks (end-of-file-fixer, trailing-whitespace,
# black) and the byte-stable tests/test_data/*.asm imports all assume it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images must never be line-ending-normalized.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
